    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "measure_text",
      "description": "requirements检查字数/项数，省略则仅计数。target默认完整reply，多份成果各用稳定id；文稿用document。已存稿可用assetId+assetVersion。items双换行拼接须覆盖text。重测沿用target；误声明用correction引用最新测量callId、本轮用户messageId、原话quote及reason。Agent仍负责语义划分。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
